# Quintessential Katana: a non-Ninja entering (Savannah Lions) offers nothing, and a Ninja (Blade-Blizzard Kitsune) may be
# declined. Bot1 equips the Lions (Equip {2}), a 3/2, and attacks; Bot2 double-blocks with two Elvish Mystics. The Lions deals
# its combat damage to both at once - one batch (CR 603.2c) - so "untap it and you gain 2 life" triggers once: Bot1 20 + 2 = 22.
# The Lions dies to the two blockers, so there is nothing to untap.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Quintessential Katana
Plains
Plains
Black Lotus
Blade-Blizzard Kitsune
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Elvish Mystic
Island x16

